  "title": "[엄나구모성형외과 정보글]가슴 보형물, 어디에 위치하는 것이 가장 좋을까?",
  "fetchedAt": "2026-01-30T04:42:53.437Z",
  "html": "<div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-87907f22-ab8b-4870-8b2b-13f1cfc8eb34\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0f5bef52-f8b3-4b7a-a939-607749956457\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-8e858ac3-8b9b-426b-a689-67e17c21846c\">가슴 확대 수술에서 절개 부위를 결정했다면, 그다음으로 중요한 고민은 보형물을 어느 깊이에 삽입할 것인가입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4c101bf3-7e66-493a-8c34-a8a2d268f8d0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-77bffcd8-74f9-491e-ad67-9cc3a6ef7bc9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5973f1d4-ebc4-4eb8-b861-4fd625777331\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-4713d987-faf1-4b8a-89cf-c86212838995\">가슴을 해부학적으로 살펴보았을 때, 보형물이 들어갈 수 있는 위치는 세 가지 방법으로 나뉩니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-db4548e0-f1f1-4898-bf35-362f0c14dcf8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-1ec0f915-5f6c-450b-9931-2c83f98a5071\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-42adac4f-fb90-4e0b-b6c2-89dbf7deb3e0\"><span style=\"color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system se-weight-unset se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-ffa0e182-9c00-43fd-b165-1e69150cfeb7\">👉</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-2f63204e-1024-4dde-a121-8161e6012535\">유선 하(유선조직 아래 삽입)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f280b150-a33c-4e7c-af4e-093bdb524ac3\"><span style=\"color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system se-weight-unset se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-02d0dcd9-825b-48ad-8e14-3717226fc991\">👉</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-58befaf6-bc07-4e34-b1cc-65b1d1568512\"> 근막 하(대흉근막 아래 삽입)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8f4b4af6-25b3-46f8-9b7b-4910136b4101\"><span style=\"color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system se-weight-unset se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-a390964a-2976-419f-9d66-da2323df8e79\">👉</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-38f5e7fe-c132-45e0-b51c-5aef9668f7c4\"> 이중평면법(대흉근 위·아래 혼합 삽입)</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-d118fe7e-403d-4b35-815d-45fb258f0d90\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-fit\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-justify\" >\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-d118fe7e-403d-4b35-815d-45fb258f0d90\", \"src\" : \"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTdfMTQy/MDAxNzQyMTM5MzM3OTk2.ae2C05cJl4JTAe9Hl5ZrJ3beOg0J-wxW6Uw_J-Lv5Gsg.vJSgADx19rn8feG99L1T__Udlz4sQyVJBWo8g1qF7nEg.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"1111\", \"originalHeight\" : \"543\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTdfMTQy/MDAxNzQyMTM5MzM3OTk2.ae2C05cJl4JTAe9Hl5ZrJ3beOg0J-wxW6Uw_J-Lv5Gsg.vJSgADx19rn8feG99L1T__Udlz4sQyVJBWo8g1qF7nEg.PNG/image.png?type=w966\" data-lazy-src=\"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTdfMTQy/MDAxNzQyMTM5MzM3OTk2.ae2C05cJl4JTAe9Hl5ZrJ3beOg0J-wxW6Uw_J-Lv5Gsg.vJSgADx19rn8feG99L1T__Udlz4sQyVJBWo8g1qF7nEg.PNG/image.png?type=w966\" data-width=\"886\" data-height=\"433\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-4ea8a562-a085-4320-a0ef-cace418e6349\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5fd476b3-cf6e-4216-91d5-ec0708e737d5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-1daaef73-05c7-4fb0-ba35-79a5fdfe17cb\">각 방법마다 장점과 단점이 존재하며, 개인의 체형과 원하는 결과에 따라 적합한 방법이 달라질 수 있습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b5c8135a-1758-4c8a-84d3-21f9e7f7da1b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-23e68de4-82ae-47a1-97f0-26920812adf4\">지금부터 보형물 삽입 위치별 특징을 자세히 살펴보겠습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-horizontalLine se-l-line1\" id=\"SE-35c570a2-3755-423d-8d96-bba30edcbad7\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-horizontalLine se-l-line1 se-section-align-justify\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-horizontalLine\">\n                                <hr class=\"se-hr\" />\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-791f6924-15d0-4e1e-a258-fe7593dfe04e\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ce566d43-4b5f-44b4-b270-22262518c674\"><span style=\"background-color:#fff8b2;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-b966e294-e14c-462a-bbb5-ac391d224ddb\"><b>◎ 유선 하(유선조직 아래 삽입) </b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3720ec58-68eb-479a-83c2-162cbb88eec6\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-c418bc0e-c6ce-4b73-a5a6-fe010f23fb7e\">현재는 거의 사용되지 않는 방법과거에는 가슴에 충분한 지방과 유선 조직이 있는 경우 선택되던 방법이지만, 현재는 거의 사용되지 않는 방식입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-70cdd4a8-c2ed-4836-8485-169b8e21859b\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-ca5109d5-dd6e-426a-9dec-a90a4a00d564\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-97222e56-4c08-4ade-b81e-692e34d2e5a0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-f09c097c-f064-47f5-8e75-4bc8c30d13fc\">  </span><span style=\"color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system se-weight-unset se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-ac842103-e27c-47cf-8dbe-30dac540927b\">👉</span><span style=\"color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-55d9c6d5-b8d7-440f-9ce1-a13c4a4dbb82\"><b> </b></span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-73138415-db8e-4919-be85-f1d9c15f574c\"><b>단점</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-50775a8b-1424-4d36-b860-c68f9c02e6b8\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-219c02a4-651b-4e04-bbed-3b708923d039\">✔ 보형물이 유선조직과 직접 닿아 있어 감염 위험이 증가</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7cc25328-c2b9-4dc7-a995-8c87c375f39d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-fc3f7b09-679a-491e-87d5-f5b24383866c\">✔ 보형물을 덮는 조직이 얇아 리플링(보형물이 겉으로 드러나는 현상)이 쉽게 발생</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d19e39af-179d-4b23-849f-8e0afaef6bb5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-048e4c54-83f1-4697-8058-b41b61447929\">✔ 장기적으로 구형구축(피막이 단단해지는 현상) 위험이 높은 편</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-83c17ac5-69e6-45c0-8f30-01ae83e85db9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-2a026376-c271-495e-9df4-0f41bb4a2353\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0fd2ebaf-2a0b-44c7-a8fd-5deea6810672\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-43c6c566-7edd-4045-ace6-07c0f1adb732\">이러한 이유로 인해 최근에는 거의 사용되지 않는 수술 방법이며, 보다 안전한 다른 방식이 주로 선택됩니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-d583b2d3-282a-4805-a735-9b030f8802f8\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-justify\" style=\"max-width:374px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-d583b2d3-282a-4805-a735-9b030f8802f8\", \"src\" : \"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTdfOTkg/MDAxNzQyMTM5NDYxNjQ3.MM2EvbbaU3yig5KIurGp27Z6lqE81Ahcjm9bJYsRup8g.lg1L5Rg6saeF7ig4PT41fzWZuD4ZpJEsIdRjOHjli2Ug.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"374\", \"originalHeight\" : \"512\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTdfOTkg/MDAxNzQyMTM5NDYxNjQ3.MM2EvbbaU3yig5KIurGp27Z6lqE81Ahcjm9bJYsRup8g.lg1L5Rg6saeF7ig4PT41fzWZuD4ZpJEsIdRjOHjli2Ug.PNG/image.png?type=w966\" data-lazy-src=\"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTdfOTkg/MDAxNzQyMTM5NDYxNjQ3.MM2EvbbaU3yig5KIurGp27Z6lqE81Ahcjm9bJYsRup8g.lg1L5Rg6saeF7ig4PT41fzWZuD4ZpJEsIdRjOHjli2Ug.PNG/image.png?type=w966\" data-width=\"374\" data-height=\"512\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-21aac430-5473-4d87-8b2f-25458b95b3fa\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-95af9a9b-ca06-48a1-9759-b8a7ae37a177\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-b1c1d7e9-6d3f-4345-b327-39a82b5aaf1d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d6f6945d-f660-49b1-a65a-d6bf7bdff076\"><span style=\"background-color:#fff8b2;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-a90ee208-3822-434d-a8a1-099ccb38a7d5\"><b>◎ 근막 하(대흉근막 아래 삽입)</b></span><span style=\"background-color:#fff8b2;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-0469f24e-59a6-4297-be08-0f3bd3793ac4\"> </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b3e1c6c5-f441-4472-9ffa-d8d81af766b2\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-3d52fcee-e111-4fc9-86d5-734f54132611\"> 빠른 회복과 자연스러운 촉감 근막 하 방식은 대흉근 위쪽의 천층 근막(Superficial Pectoral Fascia) 아래에 보형물을 삽입하는 방법입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4a54fd92-56f6-46d5-84c6-9004b76f7c93\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-8ebf4a32-ef1c-4185-87fd-f20638dc8ecb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b5cf40cd-178b-4d61-aad5-ba267edbb1e4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-2aa63be5-eecb-4801-8d3d-efe4a6ed2b6f\">이 방법은 특히 윗가슴 지방층이 충분한 경우(Pinch Test &gt; 2cm) 선별적으로 시행됩니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-02072d92-0bc1-494c-bbc0-bcc9dfe4eff3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-0a02dbb4-69a5-4e65-ba05-244e16eaa741\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b1ce8e8c-d431-4fcd-9881-7bd3f1ffb474\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-780e3328-6f46-463c-bf93-1e9831d18360\"> </span><span style=\"color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system se-weight-unset se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-d8b39c95-f5bd-4992-beb8-e73f96fc7d4b\">👉</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-c06e31e2-a17a-445e-b087-f82a1e06a8c7\"> </span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-4bee4048-f48b-42c1-a4f4-2ca030ac68c5\"><b>장점</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-262c3c91-e90b-4050-a53a-96ad8fddf756\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-0df5b91a-6b2c-47e5-b85f-a735f0281f93\">✔ 근육 손상이 없어 통증이 적고 회복이 빠름</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c1b7a12d-a883-479d-8413-774ef6c6592f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-0c65cdd4-a26d-4be2-b1cc-2661697b6eac\">✔ 가슴골을 더 모아줄 수 있어, 선명한 볼륨감 형성 가능</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bdc84573-8aa4-4dee-a83e-6a48c496c5a7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-03f57fa3-08ef-40a4-aca9-29e6fe7dd413\">✔ 근육의 압박이 없기 때문에 촉감이 더 부드러움</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9626058a-ecec-4751-9655-acf0fb8bb5e7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-4fecd174-b4dd-4dac-b0a8-f063f89d89ce\">✔ 출산 후 가슴이 처진 경우, 윗가슴 볼륨을 채워주는 효과</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-6b42aeb0-43b2-4b4d-9fe7-aac7a888a534\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-a6d5ffdc-9d91-46e5-8a5e-51fc6ef0fc15\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b7fb21d3-f987-40bf-8a47-ce15eba6c161\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-31968112-59e2-4ec5-9609-767f20a5973b\"> </span><span style=\"color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system se-weight-unset se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-c9f4d1ee-9d69-4ceb-a75c-d98e2f0d8af7\">👉</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-19966e0e-771e-4ddb-b819-0338316dff82\"><b> 단점</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-31a0ae18-41ac-4e4d-be08-20f09da85422\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-caca8a0c-936c-4c3d-af57-b6ab1fc6e54e\">✔ 유선과 지방이 부족한 마른 체형에서는 보형물이 비쳐 보일 위험(리플링 현상)이 있음</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-23d5f4a8-3ec8-4267-9f34-e9576bf3658a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-e84e7303-3886-495b-82d3-502e354aeb93\">✔ 근육이 보형물을 지탱해주지 않기 때문에 밑선부 피부가 늘어나면서 자리 잡는 데 시간이 필요</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2184b80b-1420-4ae6-858c-e85be04752f5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-6b88c635-7707-4de8-b6db-42c14ba9d932\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-62661930-c540-4879-832a-8e495e583e22\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-8b56cd97-f181-434c-b618-8751c0890f76\">이 방법은 통증이 적고 회복이 빠르며, 촉감이 자연스러운 가슴을 원하는 분들에게 적합한 방식입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-956ebe5d-1f4b-4d8b-8856-7f7fd8ddada5\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-7ff63867-6436-4f08-b692-c26ac45dea86\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-33a94d06-fa6a-4513-9b95-e450ce7b072f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-cfc40a5e-5c98-43c0-b2d1-c8014a8fa9ac\">하지만 체형에 따라 적합 여부가 달라질 수 있기 때문에 충분한 상담이 필요합니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-736b72ca-001c-4c6b-ad53-6fc781acdad8\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-justify\" style=\"max-width:352px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-736b72ca-001c-4c6b-ad53-6fc781acdad8\", \"src\" : \"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTdfMjUx/MDAxNzQyMTM5NDgzOTg3.I-EsT77GTuZX8Z7dl1GOjg-wb73HMJuKHUD4iyImkZsg.OPhM_2KmtjaTqVGkSwO87qMiKH0v32nE2-FeMqNi2Tog.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"352\", \"originalHeight\" : \"512\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTdfMjUx/MDAxNzQyMTM5NDgzOTg3.I-EsT77GTuZX8Z7dl1GOjg-wb73HMJuKHUD4iyImkZsg.OPhM_2KmtjaTqVGkSwO87qMiKH0v32nE2-FeMqNi2Tog.PNG/image.png?type=w966\" data-lazy-src=\"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTdfMjUx/MDAxNzQyMTM5NDgzOTg3.I-EsT77GTuZX8Z7dl1GOjg-wb73HMJuKHUD4iyImkZsg.OPhM_2KmtjaTqVGkSwO87qMiKH0v32nE2-FeMqNi2Tog.PNG/image.png?type=w966\" data-width=\"352\" data-height=\"512\" alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\" />\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-4abc61ad-9645-420b-a56e-cfadfb99f560\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-781eb1b9-21fd-48fb-a203-0888233c81fa\"><span style=\"background-color:#fff8b2;\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-f7c503dc-0b70-4fdc-ad88-e9e56280314d\"><b>◎ 이중평면법</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4ee0fcc7-7f8c-44c9-84c9-06f0834b0ed9\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-0ed064b1-bfee-4b0d-af59-695ee364cca9\">마른 체형에서 리플링을 방지하는 방법. 이중평면법(Dual Plane)은 윗부분은 근육 아래에, 아랫부분은 유선 조직 아래에 보형물을 위치시키는 방식입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fa0f41b7-68ef-444e-8c22-9e19278d60f7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-17cc5f09-ea6b-4ea3-8f9e-457f267a720f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-779028ad-878b-4465-ac02-368e94a7d916\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-7535ef16-81c6-46be-b8e5-f645dfe97842\">즉, 윗쪽에서는 근육이 보형물을 감싸 안정적으로 고정하고, 아랫부분은 보다 자연스러운 볼륨감을 유지할 수 있도록 설계된 방법입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-90960668-43ff-4b34-a1a5-f8bad60b371f\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-8828ddea-5d63-41a4-b59c-21e87b6548e9\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7ed5506b-bc15-49f2-aed2-538f510feb24\"><span style=\"color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-fad7bd2a-82f9-4253-ace1-da0880221b9b\"><b>👉</b></span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-6251da8c-49c2-4894-a05c-8a0d765bb89c\"><b> 장점</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-869f2395-df91-4e1f-bedf-c02a0d266e08\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-3ab9f9c0-5fb3-45b5-b836-97934c4c54cf\">✔ 가슴 조직이 얇은 체형에서 보형물이 직접적으로 만져지는 것을 방지</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f05a45d7-7ccc-4ccb-807c-85546f592026\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-ac36ddf8-8c90-4ed8-9bfe-2a72fd9a94b0\">✔ 구형구축 위험이 적어 장기적인 모양 유지에 유리</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-97b3b0c5-1f6d-4e3f-8d2e-18ccb0cfa5a7\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-38c6d07f-11f5-45b3-961e-e75094b72ed7\">✔ 근육이 보형물을 덮어주기 때문에 리플링 현상이 줄어듦</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d7030991-f679-4463-9f6a-1c6265883432\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-e76919a5-900a-49d4-ad6b-72b3260ad255\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-38b8c5ea-1d79-4005-a57c-42dcbce40c21\"><span style=\"color:#666666;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system se-weight-unset se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-b308ea94-dcec-453f-8413-91037aa0b52a\">👉</span><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi   \" id=\"SE-d675a0e5-e35d-4b9e-9e37-23814d04b07d\"><b> 단점</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7ad0c5c0-1300-40a4-99b2-6d518619f5b4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-3558caa9-9cd4-4a96-9b13-56cffec490eb\">✔ 근육에 일부 조작이 필요해 통증이 크고 회복 기간이 길 수 있음</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3e4cf5b2-29c1-47b3-9055-8a3dddafc41d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-7011a1c4-09eb-4e22-b5b4-0f5a0180fa06\">✔ 근육이 보형물을 눌러주기 때문에 윗가슴 볼륨감이 다소 적을 수 있음</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ee758acb-37b8-4956-8ac1-cc631af2ec75\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-c0662c84-9b95-4f14-8dd9-c729139f890b\">✔ 애니메이션 변형(근육을 움직일 때 보형물이 움직이는 현상)이 발생할 가능성 있음</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2e2cd310-463d-40fa-8523-613d26bb9a15\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-839db0a7-eebd-4cf8-80e9-9fece932e856\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-708989a7-29a6-4b38-b8aa-7aefebec5af4\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-03952a56-58f5-4571-898d-ea9692dfe6bc\">특히, 이중평면법은 자연스럽게 보형물이 자리 잡을 수 있도록 유두 아래쪽 근육을 부분적으로 절개하여, 보다 자연스러운 가슴 모양을 형성하는 것이 핵심입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-5d053e74-3634-49b3-b9da-982e8419387f\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-justify\" style=\"max-width:371px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-5d053e74-3634-49b3-b9da-982e8419387f\", \"src\" : \"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTdfMjA5/MDAxNzQyMTM5NjA0MTgw.AROcv2N_ISccBM_tZ78Xmbq5VeiGMi3qhZX84GNEvMwg.63QVuCL-toS83cvRnXAh3oQyhxtH9BrKxyvCxggjI-sg.PNG/image.png\", \"originalWidth\" : \"371\", \"originalHeight\" : \"510\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"