94d4-4104-a12b-4607e8192a7d\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-88d1d4c7-42e7-440c-bda3-1a03516c755b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bbd66a71-3166-4245-a87d-110a15e42dfa\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-0eacdd65-cac2-4434-bcf6-cab08b403489\">✔ 통증이 적고 빠른 회복을 원한다면? → 근막 하 방식 추천</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2dd33ea1-303a-4014-a3d6-ac09a6db8b8e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-47bf787d-5a4e-4d84-9805-b471e9079c36\">✔ 피부가 얇아 보형물 표면이 드러나는 것이 걱정된다면? → 이중평면법 추천</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-97e6997d-50e5-4c70-b816-169d8d9fea1e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-29a3544b-8431-40c2-9cef-d3aa5a6145f1\">✔ 출산 후 윗가슴 볼륨을 채우고 싶다면? → 근막 하 방식 고려 가능</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-386d9ecb-044d-4a78-a361-06efa66599ed\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-af9e7777-d6e2-48d2-9d3f-cf060c2812bb\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e5ba5c75-890a-41ae-983f-4bc186f955f3\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-854c271b-42b2-41c6-80a2-63cc3fcd415a\">개인의 신체적 조건과 목표에 따라 적절한 방법을 선택하는 것이 수술 후 만족도를 높이는 가장 중요한 요소입니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f57526b7-973e-4577-8f94-aeb895643381\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-0e982314-7fa1-4ece-bd57-d5b3298dc741\">따라서 전문의와 충분한 상담을 통해 본인에게 가장 적합한 삽입 방법을 결정하는 것이 중요합니다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-justify \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-cbf04ef1-3c6b-49e2-8e8f-bd9caeb92366\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs11 se-ff-nanummaruburi se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-047a38d7-749c-4fee-9575-c9b070c2a3e8\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-e3da202a-25f8-4ec9-b91a-9af860e6914e\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-justify\" style=\"max-width:567px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-e3da202a-25f8-4ec9-b91a-9af860e6914e\", \"src\" : \"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTlfMjc5/MDAxNzQyMzg3ODQ2MDY3.kpZbxgCYsAS6_Cwes5sj8PWCtFBwxBqQQUhyEMSSOyIg.oZYbi0jb9opxUXqOPmCWUXiRFkOabHDw0VKulTVcuJUg.JPEG/%EB%82%A8%EC%A0%95%ED%98%84%EC%9B%90%EC%9E%A5%EB%8B%981.JPG\", \"originalWidth\" : \"567\", \"originalHeight\" : \"567\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\"}'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTlfMjc5/MDAxNzQyMzg3ODQ2MDY3.kpZbxgCYsAS6_Cwes5sj8PWCtFBwxBqQQUhyEMSSOyIg.oZYbi0jb9opxUXqOPmCWUXiRFkOabHDw0VKulTVcuJUg.JPEG/%EB%82%A8%EC%A0%95%ED%98%84%EC%9B%90%EC%9E%A5%EB%8B%981.JPG?type=w966\" data-lazy-src=\"https://postfiles.pstatic.net/MjAyNTAzMTlfMjc5/MDAxNzQyMzg3ODQ2MDY3.kpZbxgCYsAS6_Cwes5sj8PWCtFBwxBqQQUhyEMSSOyIg.oZYbi0jb9opxUXqOPmCWUXiRFkOabHDw